<tr> 
<td width="100%" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" valign="top" style="width: 100%; padding-right: 39px; padding-left: 41px;"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="100%" style="width: 100%;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left"> 
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="560" class="st-mso-full-width st-mobile-full-width" style="width: 560px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" width="560"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" style="padding: 0px; width: 100%;"> <p height="20" width="100%" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; mso-table-lspace:0pt; mso-table-rspace:0pt; text-size-adjust:100%; width: 100%; height: 20px; max-height: 20px; margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 20px"> &nbsp; </p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 26px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 28px; padding-bottom: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 26px; line-height: 28px;">Webinar Spotlight: <strong>Fraud Prevention in Higher Education - </strong><strong>New Tools for the Sector</strong></span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 21px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;"><strong>Tuesday 21st October from 10AM - 11AM BST</strong></span></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;">Join <strong>Jo Brewin</strong>, Consultant, Flywire and <strong>Bridget Walker,</strong> Senior Consultant, Flywire for an engaging session <strong>introducing a new suite of free resources</strong> designed to <strong>help protect universities and their students from fraud and money laundering.</strong> This webinar will showcase Flywire’s <strong>newly developed fraud prevention toolkit</strong>, featuring practical training materials, top tips, and self-assessment questionnaires to support institutional gap analysis.</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;">We’ll also present a <strong>compelling new video series created in collaboration with We Fight Fraud</strong>. Building on the successful Crooks on Campus campaign, this updated series focuses specifically on the risks faced by international students and is tailored for use across social media platforms.</span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" class="minw-158 hover-green" style="width: 100%;">
